<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Thank you for your email.&nbsp;Your request will be handled in the order it was received.&nbsp;You can expect a response within 48 hours.&nbsp;If you are responding to a request from our team, the Specialist assigned to your case will reach out to you.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">If you would like to speak to someone by phone, please contact the Insperity Contact Center at 866-715-3552 (option 1), or via email at&nbsp;</span><a target="_blank" href="mailto:contact_center@insperity.com" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: black; text-decoration-line: none; transition: color 0.1s linear 0s; cursor: pointer;">contact_center@insperity.com</a><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">.&nbsp;Insperity Contact Center Specialists are available weekdays from 7:00 AM to 7:00 PM CST.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Thank you,&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Section 125, Health &amp; Welfare Services&nbsp;</span></p>]]></td>
